From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netrunner <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drama3: --calibration-rows dumps the MoE input and routing of
 generated requests

drama3-generate --calibration-rows NEW_DIR --text REQUESTS.jsonl generates every request, then prefills its prompt and the generated frames again and writes, for all 40 backbone layers, the MoE input x (bf16), the eight original-ID picks and the renormalized routing weights of every row, with a class byte per row (prompt text, prompt audio, generated): the GPTQ --rows layout, captured on Metal.
